        "id": 1137063
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-11-02T18:29:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m doing it this way because this change is flagged, due to trunk-stable.  `onUserPasswordChanged()` is superseded by this fix and will be removed when we remove the flag and make the fix unconditional (hopefully within a few months).  Yes, it\u0027s annoying that we can\u0027t just remove the obsolete code now.  The state where both methods exist is temporary, so I think we shouldn\u0027t refactor the code to optimize for that state -- our goal should be the cleanest final state.",
      "parentUuid": "b6761207_5d70914b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 144,
        "startChar": 22,
        "endLine": 144,
        "endChar": 39
      },
