      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-11-02T11:34:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "nit: IMHO it reads slightly clearer if this flag is inside the if block: the receiver handles a few different actions and for ACTION_USER_ADDED, we no longer calls AndroidKeyStoreMaintenance.onUserAdded() if the flag is enabled.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 860,
        "startChar": 22,
        "endLine": 860,
        "endChar": 57
      },
      "revId": "456e48f9bdc90fc5563c746cd47977c18b29944b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "eda3ed68_29167aa8",
        "filename": "services/core/java/com/android/server/locksettings/LockSettingsService.java",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 1056,
      "author": {
        "id": 1059499
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-11-02T11:34:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Instead of making MIGRATED_SP_FULL a subset of MIGRATED_SP_CE_ONLY and initializing keystore, what if we separate out the keystore initialization into a separate migration step? Seems a little easier to flag off, and no need to redo the full migration again if the new flag is flipped off and back on.\n\nTBH I don\u0027t mind either way (only nag for me is that migrateUserToSpWithBoundKeysLocked duplicates most code from migrateUserToSpWithBoundCeKeyLocked), but just thinking out aloud here.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1056,
        "startChar": 31,
        "endLine": 1056,
        "endChar": 47
      },
      "revId": "456e48f9bdc90fc5563c746cd47977c18b29944b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d4639036_bd539e59",
        "filename": "services/core/java/com/android/server/locksettings/LockSettingsService.java",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 1056,
      "author": {
        "id": 1137063
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-11-02T18:29:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Similarly to `onUserPasswordChanged()`: I\u0027m doing it this way because the change is temporarily flagged due to trunk-stable, and I\u0027d like end up with a clean state in the end once we remove the flag.  In the final state, the code will be simpler with the migrations combined.",
      "parentUuid": "eda3ed68_29167aa8",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1056,
        "startChar": 31,
        "endLine": 1056,
        "endChar": 47
      },
      "revId": "456e48f9bdc90fc5563c746cd47977c18b29944b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "a35d2239_9ba52eab",
        "filename": "services/core/java/com/android/server/locksettings/LockSettingsService.java",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 2157,
      "author": {
        "id": 1059499
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-11-02T11:34:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "nit: at the moment we do a bunch of post credential verification calls but they are scattered all over the places (onCredentialVerified() and some individual calls inside doVerifyCredentials and setLockCredentialWithSpLocked). I think long term it would be good to put them in one place.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2152,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 2157,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "456e48f9bdc90fc5563c746cd47977c18b29944b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "4461d4e8_c4f9ad2a",
        "filename": "services/core/java/com/android/server/locksettings/LockSettingsService.java",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 2157,
      "author": {
        "id": 1137063
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-11-02T18:29:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This case is a bit different from credential verification, since there\u0027s no credential being verified here.  But yes, some of the tasks like unlocking keystore and CE storage could be done in a helper function that\u0027s shared with credential verification.",
      "parentUuid": "a35d2239_9ba52eab",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2152,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 2157,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "456e48f9bdc90fc5563c746cd47977c18b29944b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e8a75a86_60d7ade9",
        "filename": "services/core/java/com/android/server/locksettings/LockSettingsService.java",
